            <div className="explanation-card">
              <h4>4) Wrong MCQs Estimate Kaise Karein?</h4>
              <p>Agar aapko Correct aur Score pata hai:</p>
              <div className="formula-box">
                <code>Wrong MCQ ≈ 3 x Correct - Score</code>
              </div>
